{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >From street vendor to empire</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1605700/extras/0e0bb9c4599f019e3d3f411a8dc56d71.poster.avif?t=1759949908\" width=800 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1605700/extras/0e0bb9c4599f019e3d3f411a8dc56d71.webm?t=1759949908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1605700/extras/0e0bb9c4599f019e3d3f411a8dc56d71.mp4?t=1759949908\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with nothing but a small street stall. Sell your first products, invest wisely, and work your way up step by step\u2014from street vendor to ruler of a gigantic online and mail-order empire.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Expand your empire</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1605700/extras/86100953accb3c624482b1252d089d35.poster.avif?t=1759949908\" width=800 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1605700/extras/86100953accb3c624482b1252d089d35.webm?t=1759949908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1605700/extras/86100953accb3c624482b1252d089d35.mp4?t=1759949908\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your empire is also growing spatially: acquire houses and warehouses, expand them as needed, and design your environment with new equipment. Every step brings you closer to your big goal.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your path to becoming a shipping giant</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1605700/extras/9b8346c0046c807887ea15367a53ea38.poster.avif?t=1759949908\" width=800 height=309 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1605700/extras/9b8346c0046c807887ea15367a53ea38.webm?t=1759949908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of shipping: pack your products, organize orders, and ensure smooth operations. From your first package to a large online empire \u2013 master the world of commerce.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Start together, grow together</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1605700/extras/23c3b74af55588fe00d8e88009418b9c.poster.avif?t=1759949908\" width=800 height=309 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1605700/extras/23c3b74af55588fe00d8e88009418b9c.webm?t=1759949908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience your adventure alone or together: build your empire in single-player mode, share quests with friends in co-op mode, or grow into a powerful trading community in multiplayer mode.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Vibrant open world</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1605700/extras/4c706666b629a7ac0c1c24765b21738d.poster.avif?t=1759949908\" width=800 height=309 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1605700/extras/4c706666b629a7ac0c1c24765b21738d.webm?t=1759949908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a vibrant open world: discover different shops, treat yourself to leisure activities, and invest your hard-earned money in new vehicles, lifestyle choices, or your next big project.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1605700?t=1759949908","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1605700/dfba1b0eef3598bee4282135305d63ee80c44e9c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759949908","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1605700/888d8a8c9373c0be0ec8edb7ac1c3cbccdaad8e9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759949908","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1605700/888d8a8c9373c0be0ec8edb7ac1c3cbccdaad8e9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759949908","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >From street vendor to empire</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1605700/extras/0e0bb9c4599f019e3d3f411a8dc56d71.poster.avif?t=1759949908\" width=800 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1605700/extras/0e0bb9c4599f019e3d3f411a8dc56d71.webm?t=1759949908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1605700/extras/0e0