merce.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Start together, grow together</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1605700/extras/23c3b74af55588fe00d8e88009418b9c.poster.avif?t=1759949908\" width=800 height=309 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1605700/extras/23c3b74af55588fe00d8e88009418b9c.webm?t=1759949908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience your adventure alone or together: build your empire in single-player mode, share quests with friends in co-op mode, or grow into a powerful trading community in multiplayer mode.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Vibrant open world</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1605700/extras/4c706666b629a7ac0c1c24765b21738d.poster.avif?t=1759949908\" width=800 height=309 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1605700/extras/4c706666b629a7ac0c1c24765b21738d.webm?t=1759949908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a vibrant open world: discover different shops, treat yourself to leisure activities, and invest your hard-earned money in new vehicles, lifestyle choices, or your next big project.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["JaJa Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1605700/62da2e9ff62b898cc6fd20195f76d2e1c28c2819/header.jpg?t=1759949908","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended